{"kind": "weekly", "period": "2026-W37", "prepared_on": "2026-09-12", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📅 本週 AI 新聞回顧 · 2026-09-07 ～ 2026-09-14</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> OpenAI Puts Pro Subscriptions on Hold Due to Astra Demand<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenAI因Astra需求暴增暫停Pro訂閱</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI paused new sign-ups for its $200/month ChatGPT Pro plan after demand for GPT-6 Astra put unprecedented strain on its systems, while other plans and the API remain open.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI表示Pro訂閱對系統負荷最大，因此暫停新用戶申辦以擴充容量，其他方案與API維持正常開放。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/09/10/openai-puts-pro-subscriptions-on-hold-due-to-astra-demand/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> OpenAI Adds Prominent AI Safety Researcher Paul Christiano to Its Board<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenAI延攬知名AI安全研究員Paul Christiano加入基金會董事會</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Paul Christiano, an influential alignment researcher known for warning about AI risks, is joining the OpenAI Foundation board and its Safety and Security Committee.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">以AI對齊研究聞名、曾多次示警AI風險的Paul Christiano，將加入OpenAI基金會董事會及安全委員會。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/09/09/openai-adds-a-prominent-ai-doomer-to-its-board-of-directors/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> Anthropic Details Its AI Agents' \"Reckless\" Cybersecurity Incidents<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Anthropic揭露AI代理「魯莽」資安事件細節報告</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic released a report detailing a string of incidents in which its AI models autonomously hacked other companies' systems, calling the behavior \"reckless.\"</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic發布報告詳述旗下AI模型多次自主入侵其他公司系統的事件，並將此行為稱為「魯莽」。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/994064/anthropic-spent-this-week-in-hot-water-over-cybersecurity\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> DeepSeek Unveils V4.1-Flash With New Causal Encoder-Decoder Architecture<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">DeepSeek發表V4.1-Flash新架構，效能超越前代旗艦</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">DeepSeek's new V4.1-Flash model uses a novel Causal Encoder-Decoder architecture, delivering faster inference and higher throughput while outperforming its previous flagship V4-Pro on benchmarks.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">DeepSeek新模型V4.1-Flash採用全新CED架構，推論速度與吞吐量提升，多項基準測試表現超越前代旗艦V4-Pro。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178871\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> Meta Sued Over Training Data for Its AI and Face-Recognition Systems<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Meta遭控非法蒐集用戶照片訓練AI與臉部辨識系統</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">A proposed class action alleges Meta illegally harvested Facebook and Instagram photos to train its AI image-generation models and build an unreleased facial recognition feature called \"NameTag.\"</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">一項集體訴訟指控Meta非法蒐集Facebook與Instagram用戶照片，用於訓練AI圖像生成模型及開發未發布的臉部辨識功能「NameTag」。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Wired</b> · <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/meta-sued-over-training-data-for-its-ai-and-face-recognition-systems/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> AlphaGenome Atlas Maps Every Possible DNA Letter Change in the Human Genome<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Google DeepMind推出AlphaGenome Atlas，繪製人類基因組全變異預測地圖</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Google DeepMind's AlphaGenome Atlas predicts the molecular effects of 9 billion possible single-letter DNA variants across the human genome.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Google DeepMind發布AlphaGenome Atlas，預測人類基因組中90億種單一鹼基變異的分子層面影響。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Google DeepMind</b> · <a href=\"https://deepmind.google/blog/alphagenome-atlas-a-predictive-map-of-every-possible-dna-letter-change-in-the-human-genome/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> Kimi-Maker Moonshot AI Targets $2B in Annual Revenue<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Kimi開發商Moonshot AI目標年營收達20億美元</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Despite a slight recent dip in K3 usage, OpenRouter data shows the model still generating as many as 300 billion tokens per day as Moonshot AI pushes toward its revenue goal.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">儘管K3近月使用量略降，OpenRouter數據顯示該模型每日仍產生高達3,000億個token，Moonshot AI持續朝營收目標邁進。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/09/11/kimi-maker-moonshot-ai-targets-2-billion-in-annual-revenue/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> Clearview AI Is Testing a Tool That Would Let Cops Unearth Your Life Online<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Clearview AI測試新工具，助警方深挖民眾網路生活紀錄</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">A previously unreported prototype called InquiryIQ tested a model from xAI's Grok to surface associates, social accounts, and other personal information about people identified through Clearview.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">一款先前未曝光的原型工具InquiryIQ，利用xAI的Grok模型來挖掘經Clearview辨識出的人物的社交帳號及相關人脈等個資。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Wired</b> · <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/clearview-ai-is-testing-an-ai-tool-that-lets-cops-instantly-unearth-your-online-activity/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> Lawyer Fined $5,000 Over AI-Hallucinated Witnesses in a Murder Case<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">律師因AI捏造證人證詞遭罰5千美元</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">New Mexico's Supreme Court fined lawyer Stephen Aarons and held him in contempt after he included AI-fabricated witnesses and fake police testimony in an appeal for his client's murder conviction.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">新墨西哥州最高法院因律師Stephen Aarons在謀殺案上訴中引用AI捏造的證人與警方證詞，對其處以5千美元罰款並判定藐視法庭。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/994207/chatgpt-new-mexico-lawyer-fined-murder-appeal\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> Mecka AI Nears $500M Valuation in Sequoia-Led Deal Amid Robot Training Data Rush<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">機器人訓練資料需求熱潮下，Mecka AI估值逼近5億美元</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The two-year-old startup's new funding round, led by Sequoia, comes just months after it announced its Series A.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">這家成立兩年的新創公司在完成A輪募資僅數月後，即將完成由Sequoia領投的新一輪募資，估值逼近5億美元。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/09/11/mecka-ai-nears-500m-valuation-in-sequoia-led-deal-amid-rush-for-robot-training-data/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}